Package: debscp
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-paramiko, python3-tk
Description: native Linux dual-pane SFTP client
 DebSCP provides saved non-secret session profiles, strict SSH host-key
 verification, local and remote browsing, queued uploads and downloads, and
 common remote file operations in a desktop GUI and CLI.

